    {
      "id": "559ab43e1a9d70a8b8b01cd37fef80e7825b0097",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1271248700,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Homebrew does it outside the postinstall script, in the Homebrew Ruby code itself. As can be seen in [Library/Homebrew/cask/pkg.rb](https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/blob/master/Library/Homebrew/cask/pkg.rb), it first removes the files and empty directories from the package, and then finally calls `pkgutil --forget`.\n\nI thought that this PR goes against the documentation, but since the postinstall script to forget `org.wireshark.ChmodBPF.pkg` is part of the `Uninstall ChmodBPF.pkg` package, I think it is reasonable.\n\nI also checked whether all files are correctly removed before forgetting the package, that appears to be the case.\n\nFiles in the ChmodBPF package:\n```\n$ pkgutil --files org.wireshark.ChmodBPF.pkg\nLibrary\nLibrary/Application Support\nLibrary/Application Support/Wireshark\nLibrary/Application Support/Wireshark/ChmodBPF\nLibrary/Application Support/Wireshark/ChmodBPF/._ChmodBPF\nLibrary/Application Support/Wireshark/ChmodBPF/ChmodBPF\nLibrary/LaunchDaemons\nLibrary/LaunchDaemons/org.wireshark.ChmodBPF.plist\n$ pkgutil --pkg-info org.wireshark.ChmodBPF.pkg\npackage-id: org.wireshark.ChmodBPF.pkg\nversion: 1.1\nvolume: /\nlocation: /\ninstall-time: 1675001590\n```\nwhich were previously deleted in the `packaging/macosx/ChmodBPF/uninstall-scripts/postinstall` script by:\n```\nCHMOD_BPF_PLIST=\"/Library/LaunchDaemons/org.wireshark.ChmodBPF.plist\"\nrm -rf \"/Library/Application Support/Wireshark\"\nrm -f \"$CHMOD_BPF_PLIST\"\n```\n\nLikewise for the `path_helper` script:\n```\n$ pkgutil --files org.wireshark.path_helper.pkg\nmanpaths.d\nmanpaths.d/Wireshark\npaths.d\npaths.d/Wireshark\n$ pkgutil --pkg-info org.wireshark.path_helper.pkg\npackage-id: org.wireshark.path_helper.pkg\nversion: 1.0\nvolume: /\nlocation: private/etc\ninstall-time: 1581601939\n```\nCovered by this script snippet:\n```\nrm -f /private/etc/paths.d/Wireshark\nrm -f /private/etc/manpaths.d/Wireshark\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 2415432,
            "username": "Lekensteyn",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Peter Wu",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/efcf30db53f30b15e7c905ef37bd4dc44d87573bd92baf97cd707115d3fcd0c0?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/Lekensteyn"
          },
